{"speciesId":615,"names":{"fr":"Hexagel","es":"Cryogonal","en":"Cryogonal","ja":"フリージオ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Si sa température monte, il se dissipe en vapeur d’eau et disparaît. Quand elle diminue, il redevient de glace."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When its body temperature goes up, it turns into steam and vanishes. When its temperature lowers, it returns to ice."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Né d’un nuage neigeux, il attrape ses proies à l’aide de sa chaîne faite de cristaux de givre."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They are born in snow clouds. They use chains made of ice crystals to capture prey."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They are composed of ice crystals. They capture prey with chains of ice, freezing the prey at -148° F."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They are composed of ice crystals. They capture prey with chains of ice, freezing the prey at -148° F."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Né d’un nuage neigeux, il attrape ses proies à l’aide de sa chaîne faite de cristaux de givre."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Nació entre nubes de nieve. Atrapa a sus presas con una cadena hecha de hielo cristalizado."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They are born in snow clouds. They use chains made of ice crystals to capture prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"雪雲の 中で 生まれた。 氷の 結晶で できた 鎖で 獲物を 捕まえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il attrape ses proies à l’aide de sa chaîne faite de cristaux de givre et les gèle à près de -100 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Usa cadenas de cristales de hielo para atrapar a sus presas y congelarlas a temperaturas de hasta -100 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They are composed of ice crystals. They capture prey with chains of ice, freezing the prey at -148 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"氷の 結晶で できた 鎖を使い 獲物を 絡め取り マイナス１００度に 凍らせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Né d’un nuage neigeux, il attrape ses proies à l’aide de sa chaîne faite de cristaux de givre."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nació entre nubes de nieve. Atrapa a sus presas con una cadena hecha de hielo cristalizado."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They are born in snow clouds. They use chains made of ice crystals to capture prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"雪雲の 中で 生まれた。 氷の 結晶で できた 鎖で 獲物を 捕まえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il attrape ses proies à l’aide de sa chaîne faite de cristaux de givre et les gèle à près de -100 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Usa cadenas de cristales de hielo para atrapar a sus presas y congelarlas a temperaturas de hasta -100 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"They are composed of ice crystals. They capture prey with chains of ice, freezing the prey at -148 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"氷の 結晶で できた 鎖を使い 獲物を 絡め取り マイナス１００度に 凍らせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il gèle ceux qu’il croise à l’aide de ses chaînes faites de givre, puis les emmène vers un lieu inconnu."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se vale de sus cadenas de hielo para congelar a todo aquel que se cruza en su camino y llevárselo a un lugar desconocido."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"With its icy chains, Cryogonal freezes those it encounters. It then takes its victims away to somewhere unknown."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"氷で 作った 鎖を 操って 出会った ものを 凍らせ どこかへ 連れ去る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Lorsqu’il fait trop chaud, il s’évapore, ce qui explique pourquoi on ne le voit presque pas en été."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando aumenta su temperatura corporal, se convierte en vapor, por lo que es muy difícil de avistar durante el verano."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","tex